	(text "Rails: green 0805 (Basic). Heater channels and MCU: red 0603.\nChannel LED from +24V_HEATER to the drain: lit = MOSFET really on.\nLit while Klipper has the channel off = MOSFET failed short (design part 1 §4.3).\nAll LEDs together along one visible board edge, each with a silkscreen label."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
